      "correspondence": "For x representing h_w⁻¹ conjugate(f_w) and s=q_(h∨)(f), Q_G(x)=s and Δcᵀx=2s. Complete the square Q_G(tx−G⁻¹c) with t=2/Δ to obtain Q_(G⁻¹)(c)≥4s/Δ²≥4λ∨(h)/Δ². Substitute in the integer covering theorem. The resulting constant C_T is used in both the dual test and the thick-representative construction.",
